abstract: >-
  Computational data package supporting the manuscript on crystallographic
  orientation control of β-Sn via preferentially oriented α-CoSn₃ thin films.
  Contains MLIP (PFP/PBE on Matlantis) results for surface energies of α-CoSn₃
  on (010), (301), (321), (600) planes; works of adhesion at α-CoSn₃ / β-Sn
  and Si / α-CoSn₃ interfaces; and DFT (OpenMX/PBE on SQUID) cross-validation
  for the α-CoSn₃ (600) / β-Sn (100) system, including bulk references and
  a charge-density-difference auxiliary calculation.
